fk)\n- There's requirements you have to met in order to use this feature.\n\nThis project is fully and heavily inspired by Left 4 Dead 2, a game developed by Valve.\nWe are still progressing in the game development since it's not fully finished. Expect bugs to happen, any bug report sent will be appreciated.","path":"/game/17742439482-left-4-blox","slug":"17742439482-left-4-blox","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/a31bd613053910353c9afacec84d32cc8a3f8ab63cffe574c0f71bcf3465f02e.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-d65dc23f2566759603baf28e45a58356/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":248,"visitor":19900504,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-04-09T13:41:48.947Z","creator":{"name":"Left 4 Blox Community","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":98073123711869,"name":"[🍃] My Grass Farm","desc":"Welcome to My Grass Farm! 🌾\n\n• Cut grass to collect hay 🌱\n• Process hay for cash 💸\n• Unlock powerful blades to cut faster🗡️\n• Hire workers to farm for you 🧑‍🌾\n• Upgrade and Expand Your Farm! 🏡\n\nRemember, your farmers cut grass while you’re offline! 🤑 \n\nNEW Code at 30k LIKES 🎁","path":"/game/98073123711869-my-grass-farm","slug":"98073123711869-my-grass-farm","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/71adc0d1173e5540ceeb458d2c5ec67132939634fd26820932cc75cad94aaede.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-5770071e2a31349cd8f8ab18ff3ad3e0/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":248,"visitor":6809261,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-08-22T19:57:40.856Z","creator":{"name":"One More Grass","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":1,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":13218487861,"name":"Team School Escape! (TEAMWORK OBBY)","desc":"","path":"/game/13218487861-team-school-escape","slug":"13218487861-team-school-escape","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/b7ffdc70ecd4985993aabdf1c6394b8890adde92dbac675e0ab88606a0c578c0.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-9871b515e4f692d88610